{"id":"torrey:church-of-israel","source":"torrey","name":"Church Of Israel","slug":"church-of-israel","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Established by God — De 4:5-14; 26:18; Ac 7:35,38.","refs":[["Deut",4,5,4,14],["Deut",26,18,26,18],["Acts",7,35,7,35],["Acts",7,38,7,38]]},{"text":"Admission into, by circumcision — Ge 17:10-14.","refs":[["Gen",17,10,17,14]]},{"text":"All Israelites members of — Ro 9:4.","refs":[["Rom",9,4,9,4]]},{"text":"Was relatively holy — Ex 31:13; Nu 16:3.","refs":[["Exod",31,13,31,13],["Num",16,3,16,3]]},{"text":"An appointed place of worship. — De 12:5.","refs":[["Deut",12,5,12,5]]},{"text":"Appointed ordinances. — Ex 18:20; Heb 9:1,10.","refs":[["Exod",18,20,18,20],["Heb",9,1,9,1],["Heb",9,10,9,10]]},{"text":"Appointed feasts. — Le 23:2; Isa 1:14.","refs":[["Lev",23,2,23,2],["Isa",1,14,1,14]]},{"text":"An ordained ministry. — Ex 29:9; De 10:8.","refs":[["Exod",29,9,29,9],["Deut",10,8,10,8]]},{"text":"The divine presence manifested in it. — Ex 29:45,46; Le 26:11,12; 1Ki 8:10,11.","refs":[["Exod",29,45,29,45],["Exod",29,46,29,46],["Lev",26,11,26,11],["Lev",26,12,26,12],["1Kgs",8,10,8,10],["1Kgs",8,11,8,11]]},{"text":"A spiritual church within it. — Ro 9:6-8; 11:2-7.","refs":[["Rom",9,6,9,8],["Rom",11,2,11,7]]},{"text":"In covenant with God — De 4:13,23; Ac 3:25.","refs":[["Deut",4,13,4,13],["Deut",4,23,4,23],["Acts",3,25,3,25]]},{"text":"The depository of holy writ — Ro 3:2.","refs":[["Rom",3,2,3,2]]},{"text":"Congregation of Israel. — Ex 12:47; Le 4:13.","refs":[["Exod",12,47,12,47],["Lev",4,13,4,13]]},{"text":"Congregation of the Lord. — Nu 27:17; 31:16.","refs":[["Num",27,17,27,17],["Num",31,16,31,16]]},{"text":"Privileges of — Ro 9:4.","refs":[["Rom",9,4,9,4]]},{"text":"Proselytes admitted into — Nu 9:14; 15:15,29.","refs":[["Num",9,14,9,14],["Num",15,15,15,15],["Num",15,29,15,29]]},{"text":"Supported by the people — Ex 34:20; De 16:17.","refs":[["Exod",34,20,34,20],["Deut",16,17,16,17]]},{"text":"Sacrifice. — Ex 10:25; Le 1:2; Heb 10:1.","refs":[["Exod",10,25,10,25],["Lev",1,2,1,2],["Heb",10,1,10,1]]},{"text":"Prayer. — Ex 24:11; Ps 5:7; 95:6.","refs":[["Exod",24,11,24,11],["Ps",5,7,5,7],["Ps",95,6,95,6]]},{"text":"Praise. — 2Ch 5:13; 30:21.","refs":[["2Chr",5,13,5,13],["2Chr",30,21,30,21]]},{"text":"Reading God’s word. — Ex 24:7; De 31:11.","refs":[["Exod",24,7,24,7],["Deut",31,11,31,11]]},{"text":"Preaching. — Ne 8:4,5.","refs":[["Neh",8,4,8,4],["Neh",8,5,8,5]]},{"text":"Attachment of the Jews to — Joh 9:28,29; Ac 6:11.","refs":[["John",9,28,9,28],["John",9,29,9,29],["Acts",6,11,6,11]]},{"text":"Required to know its statutes. — Le 10:11.","refs":[["Lev",10,11,10,11]]},{"text":"Required to keeps its statutes. — De 16:12.","refs":[["Deut",16,12,16,12]]},{"text":"Required to attend its worship. — Ex 23:17.","refs":[["Exod",23,17,23,17]]},{"text":"Separated from, while unclean. — Le 13:46; 15:31; Nu 5:2-4.","refs":[["Lev",13,46,13,46],["Lev",15,31,15,31],["Num",5,2,5,4]]},{"text":"Excommunicated for heavy offences. — Nu 15:30,31; 19:20.","refs":[["Num",15,30,15,30],["Num",15,31,15,31],["Num",19,20,19,20]]},{"text":"Persons excluded from — Ex 12:48; De 23:1-4; Eze 44:7,9.","refs":[["Exod",12,48,12,48],["Deut",23,1,23,4],["Ezek",44,7,44,7],["Ezek",44,9,44,9]]},{"text":"A type of the church of Christ — Ga 4:24-26; Heb 12:23.","refs":[["Gal",4,24,4,26],["Heb",12,23,12,23]]}],"refCount":68}
